iya, Dr. {@nickname}, and the Medic teams escape safely!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"No, my squad will handle this."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope","name2":"char_148_nearl_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Nearl","text":"Ace! Be rational, now's not the time to argue over this!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope","name2":"char_148_nearl_1#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"I am rational."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope","name2":"char_148_nearl_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Nearl","text":"Surely you can see it as well - everything around her is melting!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I'm not going to leave you all here to fight alone."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Rhodes Island... won't abandon you!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"Amiya, time is of the essence! You have to escape!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"...You should trust me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I can't bear to see Rhodes Island sacrifice anyone!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"Think about our goal! Think about what we came here for!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"This isn't the time to talk about that still!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_011_talula_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Talulah","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Battle/b_char/b_char_defboost","volume":0.5,"dela